#regex test
Server init.
>> subject := ['<html>
	<a href="http://link1" target="_blank">
	<a href="http://link2" target="_blank">
</html>'].
>> pattern := ପ୍ୟାଟର୍ନ ନୂତନ: ['href="([^"]+)" target="([^"]+)"'].
>> result := pattern ମେଳ: subject କର: { :m :x
	ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: m, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.
	ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: x, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି. <- ['XXX'].
}.
ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: result, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.